{"qid": "mt_00082_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0082", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 12566.8, "n_tokens": 229, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.36363636363636365, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 344, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.36", "answer": "根据你提供的参考资料，现就房屋租赁合同中承租人提前退租、押金返还等问题，梳理相关法律规则如下。\n\n## 一、参考资料的局限性说明\n\n需要先说明：你提供的8份判决书均为**摘要性材料**，内容高度雷同，且判决主文部分均被截断（仅到\"被告于本判决生效之日起十日\"），**未显示完整的裁判理由和判决结果**。因此，以下分析主要基于现行法律规定，参考资料仅能佐证\"依法成立的租赁合同对当事人具有法律约束力\"这一基本立场，**无法据此推断具体案件的裁判结论**。\n\n## 二、租赁合同的基本法律规则\n\n**1. 合同的法律约束力**\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第四百六十五条规定，依法成立的合同，受法律保护，仅对当事人具有法律约束力。上述参考资料中，各法院均确认\"依法成立的租赁合同对当事人具有法律", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 12.565, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民初934号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京01民初934号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民再1284号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民再1284号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）浙01民终2417号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）浙01民终2417号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）鲁01民初1480号_0", "score": 0.1835, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）鲁01民初1480号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2423号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2423号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2405号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2405号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民再2367号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民再2367号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民终2753号_0", "score": 0.1804, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民终2753号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00067_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0067", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 57.73, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.2857142857142857, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 354, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.29", "answer": "根据你提供的参考资料，就“以感情确已破裂为由起诉离婚，并主张对方存在家庭暴力、请求损害赔偿及财产分割照顾”的问题，相关裁判规则归纳如下：\n\n## 一、是否准予离婚\n\n人民法院审理离婚案件，**应当先进行调解**；经调解无效，且**感情确已破裂**的，应当准予离婚。\n\n- 依据：《中华人民共和国民法典》第1079条（调解前置、感情确已破裂准予离婚）。\n\n## 二、子女抚养\n\n应当按照**最有利于未成年子女的原则**，并结合**子女的真实意愿**确定抚养安排。\n\n- 依据：《中华人民共和国民法典》第1084条。\n\n## 三、财产分割\n\n夫妻共同财产应当依法分割，并**照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益**。\n\n- 依据：《中华人民共和国民法典》第1087条。\n\n## 四、家庭暴力与损害赔偿\n\n一方存在家庭暴力", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.056, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1471号_0", "score": 0.186, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1471号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）闽01民终1494号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）闽01民终1494号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）粤03民再417号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）粤03民再417号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）闽01民初2411号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）闽01民初2411号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民再2148号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民再2148号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京01民再2989号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京01民再2989号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00072_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0072", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 54.65, "n_tokens": 214, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.2857142857142857, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 321, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.29", "answer": "关于分居的法律规则，结合你描述的情况，说明如下：\n\n## 一、分居与“感情确已破裂”的关系\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第1079条规定：\n\n- 人民法院审理离婚案件，**应当进行调解**；\n- **感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚**；\n- 该条明确列举的情形之一即：**因感情不和分居满二年**。\n\n也就是说，分居本身不是独立的离婚理由，而是用来证明“夫妻感情确已破裂”的法定情形之一。你提到“长期分居”，若属于**因感情不和**而分居，且**连续满两年**，在调解无效的情况下，法院应当准予离婚。\n\n## 二、分居规则的几个要点\n\n1. **分居原因须是“感情不和”**\n   因工作、学习、出差等客观原因两地分居的，一般不属于该条", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.053, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民初1654号_0", "score": 0.1903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民初1654号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2492号_0", "score": 0.1875, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2492号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）浙01民再2984号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）浙01民再2984号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再461号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再461号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏05民再1876号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏05民再1876号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再459号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再459号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民再517号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民再517号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）粤03民初438号_0", "score": 0.1847, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）粤03民初438号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00062_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0062", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.95, "n_tokens": 241, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.42857142857142855, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 362, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.43", "answer": "根据您描述的情形，结合《中华人民共和国民法典》相关规定，分析如下：\n\n## 一、撤回离婚登记申请后的法律效果\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十七条规定了离婚冷静期制度：自婚姻登记机关收到离婚登记申请之日起三十日内，任何一方不愿意离婚的，可以向婚姻登记机关撤回离婚登记申请。前款规定期限届满后三十日内，双方应当亲自到婚姻登记机关申请发给离婚证；未申请的，视为撤回离婚登记申请。\n\n**关键点**：一方在三十日内撤回申请，或期限届满后三十日内未共同申请发证，均导致协议离婚程序终止，婚姻关系并未解除。\n\n## 二、撤回后能否直接提起离婚诉讼\n\n可以。协议离婚程序终止后，另一方有权直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。诉讼离婚不受离婚冷静期限制，人民法院依法审理。\n\n## 三、法院审理离婚案件的规则\n\n依据《中华人民共和国民法典》", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.048, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民再1545号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民再1545号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2397号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2397号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）闽01民再2065号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）闽01民再2065号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）浙01民初2546号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）浙01民初2546号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民初629号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民初629号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）闽01民初1397号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）闽01民初1397号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2744号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2744号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2486号_0", "score": 0.1845, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2486号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00054_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0054", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.53, "n_tokens": 208, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.8571428571428571, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 312, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.86", "answer": "关于分居的法律规则，结合你描述的情况，说明如下：\n\n## 一、分居不是独立的离婚事由，而是判断“感情是否确已破裂”的考量因素\n\n根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条：\n\n- 第1款：夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。\n- 第2款：人民法院审理离婚案件，**应当进行调解**；如果**感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚**。\n- 第3款列举了调解无效应准予离婚的情形，其中第（四）项为：**因感情不和分居满二年**。\n- 第5款：经人民法院判决不准离婚后，双方又分居满一年，一方再次提起离婚诉讼的，应当准予离婚。\n\n## 二、适用要点\n\n1. **分居的原因须是“感情不和”", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.046, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民终1542号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民终1542号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再459号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再459号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京03民再517号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京03民再517号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民再461号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民再461号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民初1654号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民初1654号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）川01民初1345号_0", "score": 0.189, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）川01民初1345号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再443号_0", "score": 0.186, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）浙01民再2984号_0", "score": 0.186, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）浙01民再2984号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00093_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0093", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 48.97, "n_tokens": 224, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.8181818181818182, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 336, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.82", "answer": "关于承租人未经出租人同意转租的规则，核心法律依据是《中华人民共和国民法典》：\n\n**一、转租须经出租人同意**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十六条第一款规定：承租人经出租人同意，可以将租赁物转租给第三人。承租人转租的，承租人与出租人之间的租赁合同继续有效；第三人造成租赁物损失的，承租人应当赔偿损失。\n\n**二、未经同意转租的后果**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十六条第二款规定：承租人未经出租人同意转租的，出租人可以解除合同。\n\n即：未经出租人同意转租，构成出租人法定解除权的事由，出租人可据此主张解除租赁合同。\n\n**三、出租人解除权的行使期限（重要）**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十八条规定：出租人知道或者应当知道承租人转租，但是在六个月内未提出异议的，视为出租人同意转租。\n\n**四", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.048, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1546号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1546号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京03民再803号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京03民再803号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪01民初1532号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪01民初1532号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1736号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1736号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民初513号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民初513号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民初655号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民初655号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民终1771号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民终1771号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京01民终1515号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京01民终1515号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00053_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0053", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 45.44, "n_tokens": 232, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.42857142857142855, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 348, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.43", "answer": "根据你描述的情形，结合《中华人民共和国民法典》相关规定，分析如下：\n\n## 一、撤回离婚登记申请后的法律效果\n\n《民法典》第1077条规定了离婚冷静期制度：自婚姻登记机关收到离婚登记申请之日起三十日内，任何一方不愿意离婚的，可以向登记机关撤回离婚登记申请。冷静期届满后三十日内，双方应当亲自到登记机关申请发给离婚证；未申请的，视为撤回离婚登记申请。\n\n**一方在三十日内撤回申请，协议离婚程序即告终止**，婚姻关系并未解除。此时另一方若仍要离婚，只能通过诉讼途径解决，这是合法的，不受\"必须先协议离婚\"的限制。\n\n## 二、直接提起离婚诉讼是否可行\n\n可以。协议离婚与诉讼离婚是两条并行的路径，协议离婚未成，不影响当事人直接向法院提起离婚诉讼。法院审理离婚案件应当先行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民再1545号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民再1545号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2744号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2744号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）闽01民初1397号_0", "score": 0.1867, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）闽01民初1397号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）浙01民初2397号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）浙01民初2397号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）苏01民终1477号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）苏01民终1477号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏01民初2452号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏01民初2452号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民终2513号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民终2513号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民再2564号_0", "score": 0.1837, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民再2564号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00081_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0081", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 45.59, "n_tokens": 226, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.8181818181818182, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 339, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.82", "answer": "关于承租人未经出租人同意转租的规则，核心法律依据是《中华人民共和国民法典》：\n\n**一、转租须经出租人同意**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十六条第一款规定：承租人经出租人同意，可以将租赁物转租给第三人。承租人转租的，承租人与出租人之间的租赁合同继续有效；第三人造成租赁物损失的，承租人应当赔偿损失。\n\n**二、未经同意转租的后果**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十六条第二款规定：承租人未经出租人同意转租的，出租人可以解除合同。\n\n即：未经同意的转租，法律赋予出租人**解除权**，出租人可据此主张解除租赁合同。\n\n**三、出租人解除权的行使期限（重要）**\n\n《民法典》第七百一十八条规定：出租人知道或者应当知道承租人转租，但是在六个月内未提出异议的，视为出租人同意转租。\n\n这意味着：如果", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.045, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京03民初1546号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京03民初1546号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京01民再2680号_0", "score": 0.1781, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京01民再2680号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民初655号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民初655号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京03民再803号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京03民再803号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）浙01民初116号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）浙01民初116号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京01民初2686号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京01民初2686号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪01民初1532号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪01民初1532号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民初518号_0", "score": 0.1747, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民初518号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00073_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0073", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.47, "n_tokens": 218, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.35714285714285715, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 328, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.36", "answer": "根据你提供的参考资料，结合现行法律规定，就你提出的问题分述如下：\n\n## 一、准予离婚的法定标准\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条**规定：人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。该条同时列举了应准予离婚的情形，其中明确包括**实施家庭暴力**。\n\n你所述参考资料中，各法院\"本院认为\"部分均表述为\"感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚\"，与上述规定一致。\n\n## 二、家庭暴力的认定与损害赔偿\n\n**《民法典》第一千零九十一条**规定：因实施家庭暴力导致离婚的，无过错方有权请求损害赔偿。\n\n因此，若你主张对方存在家庭暴力，需注意：\n- 需提供证据证明家庭暴力事实（如报警记录、伤情鉴定、证人证言等）；", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.045, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）粤03民再417号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）粤03民再417号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤03民初1548号_0", "score": 0.1831, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤03民初1548号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）闽01民初2553号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）闽01民初2553号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）川01民再2531号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）川01民再2531号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）闽01民初2411号_0", "score": 0.1802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）闽01民初2411号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00002_t1", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": "g0002", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 50.16, "n_tokens": 223, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.5714285714285714, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 335, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.57", "answer": "关于你咨询的“未约定利息的民间借贷，逾期后能否主张按LPR计算资金占用损失”问题，结合你提供的参考资料，答复如下：\n\n## 一、核心结论\n\n**可以主张，但需区分两个阶段：**\n\n1. **借款期限内**：因双方未约定利息，视为无息，出借人不能主张借期内的利息。\n2. **逾期之后**：借款人逾期未还，出借人可以主张自逾期之日起按LPR（全国银行间同业拆借中心公布的贷款市场报价利率）计算资金占用损失（即逾期利息）。\n\n## 二、法律依据\n\n**《中华人民共和国民法典》第六百八十条第二款、第三款**：\n> 借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n> 借款合同对支付利息约定不明确，当事人不能达成补充协议的，按照当地或者当事人的交易方式、交易习惯、市场利率等因素", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.049, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）粤01民再1807号_0", "score": 0.1995, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）粤01民再1807号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）鲁01民终1270号_0", "score": 0.1995, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）鲁01民终1270号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民初739号_0", "score": 0.1995, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民初739号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2475号_0", "score": 0.1995, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民再2475号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民再2338号_0", "score": 0.1968, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民再2338号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京01民终2940号_0", "score": 0.1968, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京01民终2940号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京01民初2865号_0", "score": 0.1968, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京01民初2865号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民初137号_0", "score": 0.1968, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民初137号"}]}}}
